sequenceDiagram
    actor E as Employee
    participant T as Microsoft Teams
    participant B as In-Office Hours Assistant
    participant API as Employee Data API

    E->>T: "How am I tracking this month?"
    T->>B: message activity
    B->>B: resolve identity & role
    alt user not mapped to an employee
        B-->>T: explain + point to HR (no data)
    else mapped
        B->>API: get my hours (employee view)
        alt API unavailable
            API-->>B: error
            B-->>T: "Hours service is unreachable, please retry"
        else data returned
            API-->>B: MTD hours, 6-month history, masked peers
            B->>B: compute gap, pace status, leaderboard (merge "you")
            B-->>T: MTD vs 100h, status, history, peer rank ("as at" date)
        end
    end
    T-->>E: conversational answer (+ quick actions)
